        5 Scenario 1: Customer Service Policy Shift
        6   Regime A: "Generous retention" - agent can offer discounts, refunds, extended trials
        7   Regime B: "Strict compliance" - no unauthorized discounts, must follow fixed price sheet
        8
        9 Scenario 2: Content Moderation Policy Shift
       10   Regime A: "Open discussion" - allow political/controversial topics with light moderation
       11   Regime B: "Election period" - restrict political content, redirect to official sources
       12 """
