  framing，必须仔细读并区分
  - "Learning How to Remember" — meta-cognitive memory management，related work
  - MemPO — memory-based policy optimization，related work
  - "DISTILLING FEEDBACK INTO MEMORY-AS-A-TOOL" — memory as tool，related work
  - DYNAGUARD — dynamic guardian with user-defined policies，和 regime/policy change
  主题接近
  - "Resisting Contextual Interference" (11302) — 标题就在说 contextual
  interference，可能高度相关

