  as the fix. Pilot confirmed the effect; MVG works perfectly on content moderation (100% judge accuracy, 
  collapse eliminated) but customer service needs a stronger baseline model. Next step: strengthen the customer 
  service scenario or add more scenarios, then move to full-scale experiments. (disable recaps in /config)

